body:
PR #31 adds the interface-language system (`Language` enum, English fallback, system-locale default, View ▸ Interface language switcher, `app.language.*` commands) with English and Japanese. This issue tracks adding **Brazilian Portuguese** as the next language, following the same pattern:

- `PtBr` variant in `Language`, accepting `"pt"` / `"pt-br"` codes (serde-stored as `"pt"`), with the switcher showing **Português (Brasil)**;
- a `PORTUGUESE` string table covering the same interface-chrome keys as the Japanese table (~259 labels: ribbon tabs, buttons, menus, status bar, number-format list), using Excel's established pt-BR terminology;
- `app.language.portuguese` command alongside the existing ones;
- first-run detection of a `pt-BR` system locale (the existing tag reduction already yields `pt`).

Scope is interface chrome only — command ids, file names and document text stay stable, as in #31. Localized formula function names and decimal-comma number rendering are a separate concern (cf. #45) and out of scope here.

## Summary

Deleting the first or last worksheet of a working three-sheet SUM reference makes the formula on a separate worksheet return `#REF!`, although two referenced worksheets survive. The saved formula still names the removed endpoint. Deleting the middle worksheet correctly removes only its value. This breaks automatic adjustment of a supported 3-D reference during worksheet deletion.

## Steps to reproduce

Use the source-built CLI described under Runtime or environment. Run these commands in a new disposable directory. The script creates the worksheet order `Sheet1`, `Sheet2`, `Sheet3`, `Results`, places values `3`, `5`, `7` in the first three sheets, and places the span and direct-reference controls on `Results`, outside the span.

```sh
mkdir span-delete-repro
cd span-delete-repro
cat > setup.jsonl <<'JSONL'
{"command": "home.insertSheet", "params": {"name": "Sheet2"}}
{"command": "home.insertSheet", "params": {"name": "Sheet3"}}
{"command": "home.insertSheet", "params": {"name": "Results"}}
{"command": "sheet.activate", "params": {"sheet": "Sheet1"}}
{"command": "cell.set", "params": {"cell": "A1", "input": "3"}}
{"command": "sheet.activate", "params": {"sheet": "Sheet2"}}
{"command": "cell.set", "params": {"cell": "A1", "input": "5"}}
{"command": "sheet.activate", "params": {"sheet": "Sheet3"}}
{"command": "cell.set", "params": {"cell": "A1", "input": "7"}}
{"command": "sheet.activate", "params": {"sheet": "Results"}}
{"command": "cell.set", "params": {"cell": "A1", "input": "=SUM(Sheet1:Sheet3!A1)"}}
{"command": "cell.set", "params": {"cell": "B1", "input": "=Sheet1!A1"}}
{"command": "cell.set", "params": {"cell": "C1", "input": "=Sheet3!A1"}}
{"command": "cell.set", "params": {"cell": "D1", "input": "=Sheet2!A1"}}
JSONL
gridcraft-cli run --script setup.jsonl --out before.json --print A1:D1
gridcraft-cli info before.json --json

# First endpoint.
gridcraft-cli run --in before.json --cmd 'home.deleteSheet={"sheet":"Sheet1"}' --out first.json --sheet Res…
